37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: The journey audits are striking. Most added minutes come from waiting for connections, not paying.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: The pre-war shells are a minefield. Bidders are pricing in heavy contingency after recent voids.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The ledger is thin. The operating subsidy was trimmed again, and the technology line is nearly empty.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: The ferry trial closed cleanly, but the rail and ferry back offices never agreed on data terms.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,- **Benjamin**: The late-turn pool is nearly empty. Overtime is covering both final departures and overnight works.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: The committee minutes confirm the data terms were never settled. That explains the delays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"- **Jonathan**: The accessibility records show lift rebuilds finished on time, unlike the lane work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: So the ferry pilot worked, but the data terms are still missing. That’s a gap, not a failure.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: And the maintenance contract has spare capacity. We have the hands, just not the hours.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: That fits. The mid-city runs are slower, but the platforms clear at the old rate.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: The data gap is real, but the ground beneath the old stations is the true unknown.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: The lift work held its dates. The lane work didn’t. That tells me where the risk actually sits.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,- **May**: So we have a proven pilot and a data gap. I’m ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,- **Benjamin**: Agreed. The staffing picture is clear. Let’s see what options we’re actually choosing between.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Agreed. The data points to connections, not crowding. I’m ready to see the candidates.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,- **Shizue**: Agreed. The ground and the data both speak. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,- **Jonathan**: Agreed. The records show where the risk truly lies. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
