60,3,1,talk,May,,- **May**: Candidates are here. Let’s see which one actually fits what we just uncovered.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: Candidate D is tempting, but the roster books say we simply don’t have the bodies to run it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: Candidate B targets the mid-city, but my audits show the real loss is waiting for connections, not surface speed.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: Candidate C worries me. The pre-war shells hide voids, and the contingency pricing is frighteningly high.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Candidate A’s data gap is real, but the ledger shows the technology line is already empty.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Jonathan"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Jonathan: Candidate A’s data gap is real, but the ledger shows the technology line is already empty.""}]}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Benjamin, the ferry pilot proved the tech works. The data gap is administrative, not technical.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, administrative gaps are still gaps. And I have no spare crews to fill the hours D demands.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: @May, the data gap is real, but Candidate C’s lift work actually finished on time. That’s a proven track record.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, the lift work was on time, but the ground beneath is the true unknown. I fear the delays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, the records show the lift work held its dates. The risk is in the lane work, not the stations.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,"- **May**: @Jonathan, the ferry pilot closed cleanly. The data gap is a paperwork fix, not a technical wall.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, I hear you, but the roster books are empty. I cannot promise hours that do not exist.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Midori,,"- **Midori**: @Benjamin, I understand the staffing worry, but Candidate C uses the maintenance crew that actually has spare capacity.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
